    "description": "Sri Lanka urges AI to uplift humanity, not replace labour: Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Sri-Lanka-urges-AI-to-uplift-humanity-not-replace-labour-Minister/108-342978",
    "lang": "en",
